1
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:08,430
-I'm ready. -You sure?
-我準備好了 -你確定？

2
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:11,400
Let me just straighten out your helmet there.
讓我幫你把頭盔戴好

3
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:15,270
-Thanks, Daddy. -No, no. One daddy, two mommies.
-謝謝你，爸爸 -不，一個爸爸，二個媽媽

4
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,970
-All right, it's all yours. -Okay, okay.
-好了，你去吧 -沒問題

5
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,980
There you go, there you go.
加油

6
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:26,180
Wow, Ben's first big kid's bike. This is so exciting!
這是班第一次騎腳踏車 我真的是好興奮

7
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:28,320
Oh, yeah, I remember mine.
對，我還記得我的第一次

8
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:31,050
It was my sixth birthday. I went to the park...
那是我六歲的生日 我到公園去…

9
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:34,720
-and I got on it and it bent. -Yeah.
-坐上腳踏車，它就垮了 -沒錯

10
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,390
-I never had a bike of my own. -What?
-我從來沒有屬於自己的腳踏車 -什麼？

11
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,400
We didn't have a lot of money.
我們家很窮

12
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,330
But the girl across the street had the best bike.
但住在對街的女孩 有一輛最酷的腳踏車

13
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:47,970
It was pink and it had rainbow-colored tassels hanging off the handles...
它是粉紅色的 把手掛著五顏六色的流蘇…

14
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:51,210
and a bell and this big, white wicker basket...
還有鈴鐺 一個白色的大籃子…

15
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:54,440
with those plastic daisies stuck on.
上面黏著塑膠做的小雛菊

16
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:57,250
That sounds like my first bike.
聽起來很像是我的第一輛腳踏車

17
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:00,480
My dad gave me his old one.
我爸把他以前的腳踏車送給我

18
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:03,820
-Did the girl ever let you ride it? -No.
-那個女孩讓你騎它嗎？ -不

19
00:01:04,030 --> 00:01:06,430
But she gave me the box that it came in.
但她把裝腳踏車的紙箱送給我

20
00:01:06,930 --> 00:01:09,760
It had a picture of the bike on the front.
紙箱前面印了腳踏車的圖案

21
00:01:10,370 --> 00:01:14,530
So I would sit on it and my stepdad would drag me around the backyard.
我可以坐在上面 我繼父會拖著我在後院跑

22
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,960
That is so unfair.
那真的太不公平了

23
00:01:17,310 --> 00:01:20,170
Not really, I got to drag him around too.
也不能那麼說 我也會拖著他跑

24
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:23,170
The One With All the Candy
本集播出：糖果皇后

00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:23,170
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

25
00:02:05,290 --> 00:02:07,080
Hey, what are you guys doing?
你們在做什麼？

26
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:09,380
Making candy for the neighbors.
我在為鄰居做糖果

27
00:02:09,860 --> 00:02:10,880
I'm sorry, who?
對不起，你說誰？

28
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:14,520
I'm gonna hang a basket on the door.
我要在門上掛一個籃子

29
00:02:14,730 --> 00:02:17,700
When the neighbors walk by,  they can take a piece.
只要鄰居一走過去 他們就可以拿一塊糖果

30
00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:21,330
-But we don't know the neighbors. -I do.
-但我們不認識我們的鄰居 -我認識

31
00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:24,700
There's, let's see,  the guy with the mustache...
讓我想一想 那個留鬍子的男人…

32
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:28,240
smokes-a-lot lady,  some kids I've seen...
老煙槍婆婆 我看過一些孩子…

33
00:02:28,510 --> 00:02:32,500
and the red-haired guy who does not like to be called Rusty.
還有紅頭髮的男人 他不喜歡別人叫他小紅

34
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:35,880
See, this is exactly why I'm making this candy.
看吧，這就是 我要做糖果的原因

35
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,980
We can get to know our neighbors.
我們可以認識鄰居

36
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:40,550
Wouldn't it be easier if we just moved?
搬家應該會比較簡單一點吧？

37
00:02:43,190 --> 00:02:45,390
Good morning!
早安

38
00:02:45,590 --> 00:02:48,930
-Somebody's in a good mood. -Well, why shouldn't I be?
-有人心情不錯 -我為什麼要心情不好？

39
00:02:49,130 --> 00:02:52,120
I have great friends. I have a wonderful job..
我有很棒的朋友 有很棒的工作…

40
00:02:52,330 --> 00:02:55,360
Where you can make out with your assistant.
而且可以在辦公室跟助理鬼混

41
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,760
It's not a big deal.
那沒有什麼大不了的

42
00:02:56,970 --> 00:03:01,000
We stayed up creating a plan so that us dating won't be a problem.
我們整晚沒睡在想計劃 確保我們的交往不會有問題

43
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,010
Oh, yeah? What's the plan?
是嗎？你們想出什麼計劃？

44
00:03:06,450 --> 00:03:09,680
We.. We are not...
我們…我們不會…

45
00:03:10,690 --> 00:03:12,620
going to let it...
讓它…

46
00:03:12,820 --> 00:03:14,480
be a problem.
變成問題

47
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:18,620
It took you all night to come up with that plan?
你們花了一整晚 想出那個計劃？

48
00:03:18,830 --> 00:03:21,260
Well, you know,  we did other stuff too.
你知道的 我們還做了別的事

49
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:23,650
Did you two...?
你們兩個…

50
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:26,430
Oh, I don't sleep with guys on the first date.
喔，我不會在第一次約會時 就跟男伴上床

51
00:03:26,670 --> 00:03:29,300
-Matt Wire, Mark Lynn, Ben Wise.. -Anymore!
-麥特威爾，馬克林恩，班韋斯… -我已經不會了

52
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:39,610
Hi, Tag, I have a conference call today, is that correct?
泰格，今天我要開會 對吧？

53
00:03:39,850 --> 00:03:42,870
-Yes, at 4. -Okay, thank you, that'll be all.
-沒錯，四點開會 -謝謝你，沒事了

54
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:44,610
Wait, wait.
等一下

55
00:03:49,190 --> 00:03:50,210
Did you see that?
你看到了嗎？

56
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:53,550
He had no idea there was something going on between us.
他沒發現 我們在戀愛

57
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:04,730
-I'd better get back to my desk. -Okay, hard worker.
-我得回去工作了 -好吧，工作狂

58
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:08,730
I'll put that in your evaluation.
我會在你的評估表裡提到那一點

59
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:12,040
-My what? -You've been here for two months now.
-我的什麼？ -你已經來上班兩個月了

60
00:04:12,250 --> 00:04:15,910
And your boss is required to hand in a performance evaluation.
你的上司必須為你的表現做評估

61
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:19,990
But you know, there is one thing that I have yet to evaluate.
但有一件事 我還沒有做評估

62
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:30,820
-Are you serious? -No, but I've always wanted to do that.
-你是認真的嗎？ -不，我一直都想那麼做

63
00:04:31,470 --> 00:04:33,330
Can you help me clean this up?
你可以幫我把東西撿起來嗎？

64
00:04:39,140 --> 00:04:42,370
The basket is totally empty! The neighbors ate it all!
籃子是空的 鄰居們把糖果吃掉了

65
00:04:42,540 --> 00:04:44,010
Well, either that or...
喔，不然的話就是…

66
00:04:46,610 --> 00:04:47,670
Joey!
喬伊

67
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:50,910
Yeah?

68
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:54,350
-Did you eat all the neighbor candy? -That was the plan.
-你吃掉給鄰居們的糖果了嗎？ -本來我打算要那麼做

69
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:57,820
When I got to it,  there was only a few pieces left.
我走到籃子邊時 裡面只剩幾塊糖果

70
00:04:58,030 --> 00:05:00,150
They've come by all day. They love it.
整天人潮川流不息 他們喜歡它

71
00:05:00,830 --> 00:05:02,990
They love my candy?
他們喜歡我的糖果？

72
00:05:03,230 --> 00:05:06,220
-Oh, man, I gotta go make more. -Hey, Mon.
-天啊，我得多做一點 -嘿，摩妮卡

73
00:05:06,470 --> 00:05:11,430
Make some more lasagna too. Something might have happened to a chunk of it.
多做一點千層面 或許它也會很受歡迎

74
00:05:12,340 --> 00:05:14,500
Ross, the neighbors ate all my candy.
羅斯，鄰居們吃光了我的糖果

75
00:05:14,710 --> 00:05:16,300
Mine stole my newspaper.
我的鄰居偷走我的報紙

76
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:18,070
It's like a crime wave.
這簡直是犯罪潮

77
00:05:22,250 --> 00:05:24,450
Phoebe, you got a second?
菲比，你有空嗎？

78
00:05:24,650 --> 00:05:25,810
Sure.
當然有

79
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:29,050
Ever since you told me about that bike...
自從你告訴我 那個腳踏車的故事…

80
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:31,490
I couldn't stop thinking about it.
它一直在我腦中揮之不去

81
00:05:31,690 --> 00:05:35,390
I mean, everyone should have a first bike, you know? So...
我是說大家都該有第一輛腳踏車 你知道嗎？所以…

82
00:05:39,230 --> 00:05:42,070
Oh, my God, Ross!
我的天啊，羅斯

83
00:05:42,370 --> 00:05:44,200
-You like it? -I love it!
-你喜歡嗎？ -我愛死它了

84
00:05:44,470 --> 00:05:46,700
-Yeah? -Oh, oh, God..
-是嗎？ -喔，天啊…

85
00:05:46,970 --> 00:05:48,970
And I love you.
我愛你

86
00:05:49,380 --> 00:05:50,840
Not that way.
不是那一種愛

87
00:05:51,510 --> 00:05:53,670
But the bike got you a lot closer.
但這輛腳踏車讓你跟我更親近了

88
00:05:54,350 --> 00:05:56,110
Well, take it downstairs.
喔，把它牽到樓下去

89
00:05:56,350 --> 00:05:58,180
You know, give it a test drive.
試騎一下

90
00:05:58,390 --> 00:06:00,550
Okay. Oh, my God.
好的，我的天啊

91
00:06:01,020 --> 00:06:02,920
My first bike!
我的第一輛腳踏車

92
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:06,220
Thank you for the best present I've ever gotten.
謝謝你 這是我收過最棒的禮物

93
00:06:06,860 --> 00:06:08,350
You're welcome.
別客氣

94
00:06:10,630 --> 00:06:12,790
Oh, and Chandler's about to cry.
錢德快哭了

95
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,260
Am not.
我才沒有

96
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:22,070
Who is that?
是誰？

97
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,400
Don't worry, I'm brave.
別擔心，我很勇敢

98
00:06:24,610 --> 00:06:26,940
I.. I am brave.
我…我很勇敢

99
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:30,280
No, no, no, no!
不

100
00:06:31,590 --> 00:06:33,820
Can you tell me who is there, please?
請問你是誰？

101
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:37,580
My name's Gary. I live upstairs.
我是蓋瑞，我住在樓上

102
00:06:39,930 --> 00:06:41,220
-Hi. -Hi.
-嗨 -嗨

103
00:06:41,430 --> 00:06:44,660
-Do you know what time it is? -It's candy time.
-你知道現在幾點了嗎？ -現在是糖果時間

104
00:06:45,470 --> 00:06:48,590
My roommate says they taste like little drops of heaven.
我室友說它們吃起來 就像是天上掉下來的禮物

105
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,670
Oh, please.
喔，拜託

106
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:53,840
Did you hear that? "Little drops of heaven."
你聽到了嗎？ 「天上掉下來的禮物」

107
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,970
Four a.m.
凌晨四點

108
00:06:57,250 --> 00:06:59,410
So can I get some candy?
你能給我一點糖果嗎？

109
00:06:59,650 --> 00:07:03,850
I am sorry, but some of us have to get up early and go to work.
對不起，但我們之中有人 還得早起去上班

110
00:07:04,350 --> 00:07:07,620
He does not know that I am not "some of us."
他不知道我不是「那個人」

111
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:12,750
I'm sorry, but I'll put some out in the morning.
對不起 但明天一大早我會做一些糖果

112
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,330
Okay, I'll swing by later.
好吧，我待會再來

113
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:17,430
You live in this building?
你住在這裡？

114
00:07:18,630 --> 00:07:20,500
Seems like I'd remember you.
我應該會記得你

115
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:25,570
Night, Gar.
晚安，蓋瑞

116
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:40,280
So did you read your evaluation yet?
你看了你的評估表嗎？

117
00:07:40,490 --> 00:07:42,850
No, it was marked "confidential."
不，上面寫了「極機密」

118
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:45,120
I just sent it to human resources.
我剛剛把它送到人事處了

119
00:07:48,530 --> 00:07:52,400
Please, you're kidding, right? I wrote that one as a joke for you.
拜託，你是在開玩笑，對吧？ 我故意寫那份評估表來跟你開玩笑

120
00:07:52,630 --> 00:07:54,460
A joke they would appreciate?
他們會喜歡這個玩笑嗎？

121
00:07:54,670 --> 00:07:57,040
I'm thinking, no.
我想不會

122
00:07:57,710 --> 00:08:02,110
-What did you say? -I said you were a good kisser...
-你寫了什麼？ -我說你是接吻高手…

123
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:06,640
and that I liked your teeny, tiny tushy.
我喜歡你又小又挺的屁股

124
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:09,810
No, not my tushy.
不，你不該那麼說

125
00:08:10,020 --> 00:08:11,140
It gets worse.
還有更糟糕的事

126
00:08:11,350 --> 00:08:13,480
About your initiative, I wrote:
關於你的主動性，我說：

127
00:08:13,690 --> 00:08:17,020
"He was able to unhook my bra with minimal supervision."
「他幾乎不需要指導 就能解開我的胸罩」

128
00:08:18,330 --> 00:08:22,890
Under problems with performance,  I wrote, "Dear God, I hope not."
至於你的表現會不會有問題 我說：「天啊，希望不要有」

129
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:27,560
And then.. And then I drew a little smiley face.
然後…然後我劃了 一個微笑的小臉

130
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:31,000
And then a small pornographic sketch.
還有一張色情小素描

131
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:43,220
That is so sweet of you to get Phoebe that bike.
你送菲比腳踏車 真的太貼心了

132
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:45,720
When I heard the story, I almost cried.
我聽到那個故事時 差點就哭了

133
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,410
Almost cried, huh?
你差點哭了？

134
00:08:47,690 --> 00:08:50,020
Hear that, Chandler? "Almost" cried.
你聽到了嗎？錢德，「差點」哭了

135
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:54,520
Hey, you cry every time somebody talks about Titanic.
只要有人提到《鐵達尼克號》 你每次都會哭

136
00:08:54,900 --> 00:08:57,300
Those two had only each other.
他們兩個只有彼此

137
00:08:58,470 --> 00:08:59,900
She really likes it, huh?
她真的很喜歡它吧？

138
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:02,700
Oh, yeah. I saw her walking it down the street.
對，我看到她牽著它過街

139
00:09:02,900 --> 00:09:05,960
She had these flowers in the basket. It was so cute.
她的籃子裡面還有花 那真的很可愛

140
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,970
I saw her this morning, walking it by the park.
今天早上我看到她 牽著它在公園散步

141
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:11,900
Wait, she was walking the bike?
等一下，她牽著腳踏車？

142
00:09:12,110 --> 00:09:13,770
Both times?
兩次都是？

143
00:09:15,050 --> 00:09:17,240
-Hey, Phoebe. -Oh, hi!
-嗨，菲比 -嗨

144
00:09:17,490 --> 00:09:21,290
-Hey, so you enjoying the bike? -Oh, uh-huh, so much.
-你喜歡你的腳踏車嗎？ -非常喜歡

145
00:09:21,990 --> 00:09:27,090
Phoebe, you do know how to ride a bike, don't you?
菲比，你會騎腳踏車吧？

146
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,450
Of course.
當然

147
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,630
Can we see you ride it?
我們能看你騎腳踏車嗎？

148
00:09:33,830 --> 00:09:35,320
Okay.
好吧

149
00:09:49,820 --> 00:09:51,280
See?
你們看到了嗎？

150
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:02,590
I told you not to get involved with your assistant.
我早就跟你說 不要跟助理交往

151
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:06,160
There's no such thing as a secret when it comes to affairs.
只要是地下情 絕對是紙包不住火的

152
00:10:07,100 --> 00:10:09,160
Did you hear that, Chandler?
你聽到了嗎？錢德

153
00:10:09,970 --> 00:10:11,340
No such thing.
紙是包不住火的

154
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:15,740
What happened? I'm just eating candy.
發生了什麼事？我只是在吃糖果

155
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:21,350
Maybe it's not that bad. They might not take it the way I meant it.
或許沒有那麼糟糕 他們可能看不懂我的意思

156
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:25,280
Absolutely, you know? Because "tushy" can mean both ass...
當然囉，你知道嗎？ 因為「小屁屁」可以指屁股…

157
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:27,040
and good worker.
跟好員工

158
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:30,950
I just gotta get the thing back.
我得把評估表拿回來

159
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:33,130
Rach? That sketch you mentioned?
瑞秋，還記得你提到的素描嗎？

160
00:10:33,330 --> 00:10:35,960
Might it have looked a little like this?
它跟這幅素描很像嗎？

161
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,130
Oh, my God, Joey!
我的天啊，喬伊

162
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:42,300
-What is the matter with you? -God!
-你是怎麼了？ -天啊

163
00:10:43,900 --> 00:10:47,930
This little talent came in handy before I could afford porn.
在我買不起色情雜誌前 這點天份還蠻有用的

164
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:57,550
Hi, I'm sorry. I know it's after hours, but I really need candy.
嗨，對不起，我知道現在是 休息時間，但我真的需要糖果

165
00:10:57,990 --> 00:11:01,050
I'm sorry, I can't help you. See? Rules are rules.
對不起，我幫不了你 看到了沒？規定就是規定

166
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:04,250
Please, I have people coming from out of town today.
拜託，我住在外地的朋友 今天來看我

167
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:07,330
-I told them all about your candy. -You're kidding.
-我跟他們提起你的糖果 -你是在開玩笑

168
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:10,590
Out-of-towners, huh? What did you tell them?
他們是外地來的？ 你怎麼跟他們說的？

169
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:14,200
I told them your candy was absolutely indescribable.
我告訴他們你的糖果 真的是好吃到無法形容

170
00:11:14,470 --> 00:11:19,430
Some people have said it's "little drops of heaven." But whatever.
有人說它是「天上 掉下來的禮物」，但那不重要

171
00:11:20,010 --> 00:11:23,970
-Please, can't you help me out? -Hey, Chandler, do we know that lady?
-拜託，你不能幫幫我嗎？ -錢德，我們認識那位女士嗎？

172
00:11:24,180 --> 00:11:28,210
Isn't she the woman who lives below you and has sex really loud?
她不是住在你樓下 做愛時會大叫的那個女人嗎？

173
00:11:28,450 --> 00:11:30,640
All right, I'll do it just this once.
好吧，我只破例一次

174
00:11:30,850 --> 00:11:34,120
-But you can't tell anyone. -Please, just give it to me.
-但你不能告訴任何人 -求求你，快給我吧

175
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,480
Yeah, that's her.
對，就是她

176
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:39,320
-Thank you. -Unbelievable!
-謝謝你 -不可思議

177
00:11:39,530 --> 00:11:41,960
I can't believe that sign didn't work.
我不敢相信紙條沒有用

178
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:45,160
You know what would work? Stop making candy.
你知道什麼才會有用嗎？ 別再做糖果了

179
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:47,400
But they like it.
但他們喜歡它

180
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,670
You mean they like you.
你是說他們喜歡你

181
00:11:51,010 --> 00:11:51,990
Maybe.
或許吧

182
00:11:52,370 --> 00:11:55,640
Is that why you became a chef,  so people would like you?
那就是你當廚師的原因？ 你要大家喜歡你？

183
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:59,900
You want to talk about getting people to like you, huh, funny man?
你要跟我談怎麼讓別人 喜歡你嗎？小丑

184
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:12,850
Just remember everything I taught you and you'll be fine.
記住我教你的一切 你會沒事的

185
00:12:13,060 --> 00:12:14,820
Okay? Here we go.
好嗎？開始吧

186
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:16,930
Ready, set..
就位，預備…

187
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:20,070
Wait, this seat is really uncomfortable.
等一下，這個椅子 真的很不舒服

188
00:12:20,330 --> 00:12:23,430
Maybe before we start we should just get another one.
或許我們得換張椅子 再來練習

189
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:27,070
Perhaps like an airplane seat, or a beanbag chair!
或許我們該換個飛機座椅 或懶骨頭

190
00:12:28,010 --> 00:12:32,170
You can't get out of this. You have to learn how to ride a bike.
你不能逃避這件事 你得學會騎腳踏車

191
00:12:32,380 --> 00:12:35,280
Why? Why do I have to learn?
為什麼我非學不可？

192
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:40,690
-Well, in case of an emergency. -What kind of emergency?
-以防發生緊急事故 -什麼樣的緊急事故？

193
00:12:40,890 --> 00:12:45,350
Well, what if a man comes along and puts a gun to your head and says:
如果有人走過來 拿槍抵著你的頭說：

194
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:48,220
"You ride this bike or I'll..
快騎上腳踏車，不然我會…

195
00:12:48,530 --> 00:12:50,930
I'll shoot you."
我會開槍打你

196
00:12:51,370 --> 00:12:53,700
I would ring the bell to distract him.
我會按鈴鐺分散他的注意力

197
00:12:53,900 --> 00:12:57,560
Then I would knock the gun away with a Chinese throwing star.
然後我會用中國的飛鏢 把那個傢伙敲昏

198
00:12:58,740 --> 00:13:01,970
Okay, Phoebe, just get on the bike...
好吧，菲比，快坐上腳踏車…

199
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:06,040
and, hey, I'll hold you up and push you. Okay?
我會扶著你幫你推，好嗎？

200
00:13:07,410 --> 00:13:08,900
You won't let go?
你不會放手？

201
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:10,480
-No. -You swear?
-我不會 -你發誓

202
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:11,950
I swear.
我發誓

203
00:13:13,790 --> 00:13:15,620
-Okay. -Come on.
-好吧 -來吧

204
00:13:18,690 --> 00:13:20,180
Here we go. All right?
好了，要開始了，好嗎？

205
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:21,450
All right?
-好吧 -好嗎？

206
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:23,650
Feel good? All right, try pedaling.
感覺不錯吧？ 好了，試著踩踏板

207
00:13:23,830 --> 00:13:26,990
That's it, you're doing great. Yes, take control.
對了，你做的很好 對，控制住車子

208
00:13:27,230 --> 00:13:29,500
Yes, yes, yes!
這就對了

209
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,740
Oh, no!
喔，不

210
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,770
You swore!
你發過誓的

211
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:41,640
-I just thought you were doing so well. -I am shocked. Shocked!
-我認為你騎得很好 -我真的很震驚

212
00:13:46,250 --> 00:13:48,740
It's a legitimate learning technique.
大家都是那樣子學腳踏車的

213
00:13:49,890 --> 00:13:51,260
Wow.
哇

214
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:04,170
Hey, there's some people outside asking about candy.
嘿，外面有些人在問糖果的事

215
00:14:04,370 --> 00:14:07,700
They'll just have to wait, okay? I only got two hands!
他們得等，好嗎？ 我只有兩隻手

216
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:11,270
-Need some help? -No, you don't know the system.
-需要我幫忙嗎？ -不，你不熟悉流程

217
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:13,970
I don't need nobody messing with the system!
我不希望任何人破壞我的流程

218
00:14:14,820 --> 00:14:18,880
By the way, the week before your wedding, you may not see a lot of me.
還有，你結婚前一個星期 不會常常看到我

219
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,230
Oh, hello, liar.
嗨，騙子

220
00:14:33,870 --> 00:14:37,700
Look, I'm really sorry I let go of the bike.
聽著，我真的很抱歉 放開了你的腳踏車

221
00:14:37,910 --> 00:14:39,930
I could've been killed, you know.
我可能會沒命的

222
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:43,710
I know, I know.
我知道

223
00:14:45,450 --> 00:14:47,570
But can we please try it again?
但你能再試一次嗎？

224
00:14:47,850 --> 00:14:50,180
I mean, you were so close, Phoebe.
我是說你只差一點就成功了，菲比

225
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:52,940
Well, I would love to...
喔，我很樂意…

226
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:56,950
but the bike got stolen and the police have no suspects.
但腳踏車被偷了 警察找不到嫌犯

227
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:04,690
-Phoebe. -What?
-菲比 -什麼？

228
00:15:07,770 --> 00:15:09,630
What the hell?
怎麼會這樣？

229
00:15:11,140 --> 00:15:12,200
You know what?
你知道嗎？

230
00:15:12,410 --> 00:15:15,530
If you won't learn how to ride,  then I'm sorry...
如果你不學騎腳踏車 那麼我很抱歉…

231
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:17,770
-I have to take it back. -But why?
-我得把它收回去 -什麼？為什麼？

232
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:21,340
Because it's...
因為它…

233
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:25,620
It'd be like you having this guitar...
它就像你買了這把吉他…

234
00:15:25,850 --> 00:15:27,620
and never playing it.
卻從來不彈它

235
00:15:27,890 --> 00:15:30,760
Okay, this guitar wants to be played.
好吧，這把吉他希望被彈

236
00:15:30,990 --> 00:15:34,090
And this bike wants to be ridden.
這輛腳踏車希望被騎

237
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:36,590
And if you don't ride it...
如果你不騎它…

238
00:15:36,860 --> 00:15:40,890
you're killing its spirit.
你就是在扼殺它的靈魂

239
00:15:42,900 --> 00:15:44,170
The bike...
腳踏車…

240
00:15:45,070 --> 00:15:46,770
is dying.
快死了

241
00:15:50,810 --> 00:15:55,310
All right. If you care enough to make up that load of crap, okay.
好吧，如果你真的那麼在乎 不惜撒下漫天大謊，我學就是了

242
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:57,180
Great.
太棒了

243
00:15:59,790 --> 00:16:01,810
You're making the bike very happy.
你讓腳踏車非常快樂

244
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:03,280
Okay, Ross.
知道啦，羅斯

245
00:16:06,190 --> 00:16:08,020
Please don't die!
請不要死掉

246
00:16:11,630 --> 00:16:14,120
To get the evaluation before they see it...
我們得在他們看到評估表前 把它拿回來…

247
00:16:14,340 --> 00:16:18,900
we gotta get into Zelner's office. He doesn't get in until 10.
所以我們得溜進查納的辦公室 通常他十點才會到

248
00:16:19,110 --> 00:16:23,130
But his assistant, Betty, comes in early to eat breakfast at her desk.
但他的助理貝蒂一大早 就會到辦公室吃早餐

249
00:16:23,340 --> 00:16:26,610
-That's kind of sad. -Yeah, well, Betty's kind of sad.
-那真的很悲慘 -沒錯，貝蒂有點慘

250
00:16:27,010 --> 00:16:30,780
Which is why I believe I can lure her away with these chocolates.
所以我相信我可以 用這些巧克力把她誘開

251
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:34,410
While I distract her, you go in.
我誘開她後，你就跑進去

252
00:16:34,620 --> 00:16:35,990
-Got it. -Let's roll.
-我知道了 -我們行動吧

253
00:16:37,690 --> 00:16:39,920
Hello, Rachel. You got a minute?
嗨，瑞秋，你有空嗎？

254
00:16:40,130 --> 00:16:43,460
Yeah, sure, Mr. Zelner. For you? Anything. Minute.
當然，查納先生 你有事嗎？我隨時都有空

255
00:16:43,660 --> 00:16:45,500
Okay, great.
好吧，太棒了

256
00:16:45,730 --> 00:16:47,330
Abort the plan.
取消計劃

257
00:16:48,140 --> 00:16:50,800
Actually, I'd like to speak to both of you.
事實上，我想跟你們兩個談一談

258
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,470
Okay.
好的

259
00:16:53,570 --> 00:16:58,030
Well, can we get you anything,  Mr. Zelner? Maybe some chocolates.
有什麼事需要幫忙嗎？查納先生 或許你想吃點巧克力

260
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:02,340
No, thanks,  but I'll give these to Betty.
不，謝謝你 但我可以把它們送給貝蒂

261
00:17:04,350 --> 00:17:07,050
So, I read your evaluation of Tag.
我看過你對泰格做的評估表

262
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:10,650
Or, to use his full name,  Tag "Sweet Cheeks" Jones?
或許我該叫他的全名 泰格「小可愛」瓊斯？

263
00:17:12,390 --> 00:17:14,550
Is something going on with you two?
你們之間有什麼嗎？

264
00:17:16,060 --> 00:17:20,190
Oh, my God,  can you imagine if there was?
我的天啊 你能想像如果有會怎麼樣嗎？

265
00:17:21,970 --> 00:17:25,530
I mean, what would happen exactly?
如果是那樣的話會怎樣？

266
00:17:26,710 --> 00:17:29,200
Well, I'd be forced to file a report.
那樣啊，我一定得寫份報告

267
00:17:29,410 --> 00:17:32,110
I'd have to consult with the legal department.
我得跟法律部門商量

268
00:17:32,350 --> 00:17:35,610
And your future at the company would be in jeopardy.
你們在公司的未來 可能會有問題

269
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:38,340
-Well.. -Mr. Zelner...
-喔… -查納先生…

270
00:17:39,050 --> 00:17:41,210
I filled in that evaluation.
那份評估表是我寫的

271
00:17:41,420 --> 00:17:42,750
-Oh, no.. -Yeah, yeah.
-喔，不… -對

272
00:17:43,020 --> 00:17:45,010
I thought it would be funny.
我以為這會很好玩

273
00:17:46,290 --> 00:17:49,190
You wrote that you have a cute tushy?
你寫著你有可愛的小屁屁？

274
00:17:50,730 --> 00:17:51,760
Yes.
對

275
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:54,430
I have a weird sense of humor.
我的幽默感很奇怪

276
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:57,190
And I'm kind of strangely proud of my butt.
很奇怪地 我以自己的屁股為榮

277
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,870
It's kind of a risky joke, Tag.
開這種玩笑太危險了，泰格

278
00:18:01,510 --> 00:18:04,200
What is this drawing? I can't figure it out.
這到底是在劃什麼？我看不懂

279
00:18:04,410 --> 00:18:07,740
It's upside down, you gotta.. It doesn't matter.
它倒過來了，你得… 那不重要

280
00:18:09,150 --> 00:18:11,640
It's not like I don't have a sense of humor.
我不是沒有幽默感的人

281
00:18:11,890 --> 00:18:15,450
Hell, I even enjoy a naughty limerick every now and then.
沒錯，我甚至很喜歡 寫打油詩

282
00:18:18,090 --> 00:18:19,720
There's a time and a place.
但時間跟地點是很重要的

283
00:18:21,730 --> 00:18:24,420
Unless you have a limerick right now.
除非你有寫打油詩的靈感

284
00:18:27,030 --> 00:18:30,770
No? Okay. Well, you've got my fax number.
沒有嗎？好吧 你知道我的傳真機號碼

285
00:18:38,810 --> 00:18:41,410
I can't believe you did that. That was sweet.
我不敢相信你會那麼做 那太貼心了

286
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:44,480
-Don't worry about it. -You could've lost your job.
-別擔心 -你可能會丟掉工作

287
00:18:44,750 --> 00:18:47,950
Are you kidding me? With this cute butt, I'd find work.
你在開玩笑嗎？有這麼可愛的屁股 我一定能找到工作

288
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:52,130
Thank you, you're great.
謝謝你，你太棒了

289
00:18:54,190 --> 00:18:56,130
-You know what? -What?
-你知道嗎？ -什麼？

290
00:18:56,430 --> 00:18:58,190
I feel great.
我感覺棒極了

291
00:18:58,830 --> 00:19:00,700
In fact...
事實上…

292
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,460
What?
什麼？

293
00:19:07,170 --> 00:19:11,080
It's just.. It took me so long to get that desk organized.
我只是…我花了很多時間 才把桌子整理好

294
00:19:11,450 --> 00:19:13,210
I'm sorry.
對不起

295
00:19:14,350 --> 00:19:16,280
There it is.
這就對了

296
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,360
What is going on?
怎麼了？

297
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:32,960
We're waiting for the candy. Bring out the candy!
我們在等糖果 把糖果拿出來

298
00:19:33,170 --> 00:19:35,530
Yeah, lady, give us candy.
對，小姐，快給我們糖果

299
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:38,130
Joey!
喬伊

300
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:41,200
-What's up, buddy? -What are you doing?
-什麼事？兄弟 -你在做什麼？

301
00:19:42,910 --> 00:19:44,500
Waiting to get candy.
我在等著拿糖果

302
00:19:45,150 --> 00:19:46,810
Get in here.
快進來

303
00:19:47,110 --> 00:19:50,550
Hey, and you cannot smoke in here.
嘿，你不能在這裡抽煙

304
00:19:54,050 --> 00:19:55,420
Merry Christmas.
耶誕快樂

305
00:19:56,660 --> 00:20:00,860
The candy is coming! I need another 15 minutes for it to cool.
糖果做好了，我得讓它 冷卻十五分鐘

306
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:07,030
All right, everybody, just be quiet. Be quiet! Be quiet! Pipe down!
好了，大伙們，安靜 安靜，請閉嘴

307
00:20:07,230 --> 00:20:09,360
What is the matter with you people?
你們是怎麼了？

308
00:20:09,570 --> 00:20:12,700
This woman was trying to do a nice thing for you.
這個女人在為你們做好事

309
00:20:12,910 --> 00:20:16,360
She was making candy so she could get to know all of you...
她想做糖果 是為了要認識你們

310
00:20:16,580 --> 00:20:20,040
and I'll bet that not one of you can tell me her name.
我敢說你們沒有人 能叫出她的名字

311
00:20:20,250 --> 00:20:21,710
Am I right?
我沒說錯吧？

312
00:20:22,420 --> 00:20:24,280
Candy Lady?
她是糖果小姐？

313
00:20:25,590 --> 00:20:27,920
No, not "Candy Lady."
不，不是「糖果小姐」

314
00:20:28,690 --> 00:20:31,060
If we know it, can we have candy?
知道她的名字就能拿到糖果嗎？

315
00:20:32,230 --> 00:20:33,960
All right, you know what?
好吧，你們知道嗎？

316
00:20:34,700 --> 00:20:36,720
Forget it, you've ruined it.
忘了糖果，你們毀了一切

317
00:20:36,930 --> 00:20:38,960
Go home. You've ruined it.
回家去吧，你們毀了一切

318
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:42,930
That's all wrong! You guys ruined everything. You ruined it!
那是不對的，你們毀了一切 你們毀了這個機會

319
00:20:49,780 --> 00:20:52,300
-Thank you. -You're welcome.
-謝謝 -別客氣

320
00:20:54,380 --> 00:20:55,470
Did you smoke?
你抽了煙嗎？

321
00:20:56,180 --> 00:21:01,590
No, smokes-a-lot lady blew smoke directly into my mouth.
不，老煙槍婆婆 把煙直接噴入我的嘴巴裡

322
00:21:02,590 --> 00:21:03,950
Are you okay?
你沒事吧？

323
00:21:04,190 --> 00:21:06,790
Fine, but it was really scary for a while.
我沒事 但剛剛真的有點可怕

324
00:21:06,990 --> 00:21:10,090
Someone slipped a threatening note under the door!
有人會將恐嚇紙條 塞到門縫下

325
00:21:10,300 --> 00:21:14,230
Oh, yeah. Sorry about that. Mob mentality or whatever.
對了，我很抱歉 我的暴力傾向發作了

326
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:28,410
I can't believe it. I did it. I rode a bike!
我不敢相信，我辦到了 我會騎腳踏車了

327
00:21:28,580 --> 00:21:31,570
I never thought I'd be able to do that. Thank you.
我從來沒想過我能 這麼做，謝謝你

328
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:34,150
Oh, hey, don't thank me. Thank yourself.
嘿，別謝我 謝謝你自己

329
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:38,190
You're the one who faced your fears and ultimately overcame them.
是你面對了自己的恐懼 終於克服了它們

330
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:42,260
Don't be so corny, Ross. It's not an After School Special.
別說些陳腔濫調的話 這不是輔導課

331
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


332
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
